{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11205080","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11205080","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1120508001:1":{"text":"Koko, what brings you here? Listen, Alkali isn't the safest place to be right now! There's a giant beast lurking around the village!","source_cn":"卡卡，你怎么自己一个人来咸水镇了？现在咸水镇乱糟糟的，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x74EB29EAEFD50251","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1120508002:1":{"text":"With Patto by my side, I'm not scared, not even one bit! ","source_cn":"我不怕，卡卡有帕托！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DC4AE29977C76D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120508003:0":{"text":"*Roar*","source_cn":"嗷哼哼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46DDA360186CA4A4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120508004:1":{"text":"Ahhhhh!!! <style=\"highlight\">A b-beast</style>!!!","source_cn":"噫——！<style=highlight>野、野兽</...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2AB32FEC46698AB2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1120508005:1":{"text":"Look at its fangs! RUN!!! I DON'T WANT TO BE EATEN ALIVE!!!","source_cn":"它露出尖牙了！！快——快跑！不然会被吃掉！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB267F607D1B1B974","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1120508005":{"text":"Look at its fangs! RUN!!! I DON'T WANT TO BE EATEN ALIVE!!!","source_cn":"它露出尖牙了！！快——快跑！不然会被吃掉！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB267F607D1B1B974","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120508006:5":{"text":"Huh? Why are the villagers so scared? Patto and I didn't do anything...","source_cn":"害怕？为什么？我和帕托什么也没做。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC39A68D4ECB6A469","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1120508007:1":{"text":"Listen! I've just faced the scariest, most horrifying thing ever! It's gone! <style=\"highlight\">The fabric store is gone</style>!","source_cn":"最可怕最可怕的事在这里！不见了——<style=hig...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7681EE0081C1D51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1120508008:1":{"text":"Huh? The fabric store is on the other side of the village. We saw it on our way here!","source_cn":"你在说什么呀，布料店就在镇子另一头呀，我们之前还路过过。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9FCDCADC6CF8A6B9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1120508009:1":{"text":"But this map